{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794584667021,"sessionID":"ses_e2a6bf669ffeJRES2BwxWW7HJt","part":{"partID":"prt_1d594dec8001ISHGcExuOwH5K0","sessionID":"ses_e2a6bf669ffeJRES2BwxWW7HJt","messageID":"msg_1d594c507001UEv2vFWpsPQ3Zd","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-afc8dabff1378bf0","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/AGENTS.md","oldString":"2. B) Direct call: run `node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend --json '{\"prompt\":\"[request]\"}' --format json` when no hook brief is present or when diagnosing hook behavior.","newString":"2. B) Direct call: run `printf '%s' '{\"prompt\":\"[request]\"}' | node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend --json - --format json` when no hook brief is present or when diagnosing hook behavior."},"output":"Edited AGENTS.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"AGENTS.md","patch":"Index: AGENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- AGENTS.md\n+++ AGENTS.md\n@@ -61,9 +61,9 @@\n | **Override** | Blockers/conflicts → ask regardless of score |\n \n #### GATE 2: SKILL ROUTING [REQUIRED for non-trivial tasks]\n 1. A) Primary: use the Skill Advisor Hook brief the runtime surfaced, when present. See `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md`.\n-2. B) Direct call: run `node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend --json '{\"prompt\":\"[request]\"}' --format json` when no hook brief is present or when diagnosing hook behavior.\n+2. B) Direct call: run `printf '%s' '{\"prompt\":\"[request]\"}' | node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend --json - --format json` when no hook brief is present or when diagnosing hook behavior.\n 3. C) Cite user's explicit direction: \"User specified: [exact quote]\"\n - Confidence ≥ 0.8 → MUST invoke skill | < 0.8 → general approach | User names skill → cite and proceed\n - **Command in the brief.** A brief or advisor result that names a command offers its workflow beside the skill's. Take either path whole, never an improvised one. To take the command, read its document in full and follow it. `run` starts it now. `start` starts it without `:auto`, so its setup asks. `ask` offers it in one question and waits. A typed command or explicit instruction outranks the policy. Output: `COMMAND: [/name] → [started|offered|declined]`\n - **Artifact trigger — binds on what you write, regardless of the advisor score.** Before the FIRST code write, route through `sk-code`. Before the FIRST `.md` write, route through `sk-doc`, except spec-folder docs (`system-spec-kit`'s) and the gitignored runtime state Gate 3 exempts, which no skill owns. Routing means loading what its ROUTER.md resolves, per Gate 5's loading rule. A skill already in context is not re-read. A resolved contract wrong for this case is followed and amended, per PLAN-WORKFLOW LOCK step 4.\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited AGENTS.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/AGENTS.md\", \"oldString\": \"2. B) Direct call: run `node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend --json '{\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"[request]\\\"}' --format json` when no hook brief is present or when diagnosing hook behavior.\", \"newString\": \"2. B) Direct call: run `printf '%s' '{\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"[request]\\\"}' | node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend --json - --format json` when no hook brief is present or when diagnosing hook behavior.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794584665800,"end":1794584667021}}}}
